# Local-only reference documents (CRA form packages, etc.). These are Crown
# copyright on different terms from the SI/97-5 consolidations in
# docs/sources/, and this repo ships a commercial licence — so they stay out
# of git until that question is settled in docs/SOURCES-CA.md. Parameter
# VALUES extracted from them are committed (facts are not copyrightable);
# the documents themselves are not.
# Exclude the CONTENTS, not the directory itself: git does not descend into
# an excluded directory, so a `!` re-include under `docs/reference-local/`
# would never match and the README would vanish too.
docs/reference-local/*
!docs/reference-local/README.md
